WEBVTT

01:40.900 --> 01:44.300
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.080 --> 01:47.210
[Episode 14]

01:50.630 --> 01:52.030
You're weak and lack vitality.

01:52.229 --> 01:53.950
Soft-shelled turtles are cold in nature.

01:54.110 --> 01:55.030
If you eat too much,

01:55.500 --> 01:56.789
you'll die sooner.

01:57.670 --> 01:59.070
No need for your concern.

01:59.670 --> 02:01.510
You're not exactly young yourself.

02:01.780 --> 02:03.560
Who knows which of us

02:03.710 --> 02:05.030
will die first?

02:17.310 --> 02:18.460
What are you looking at?

02:19.310 --> 02:22.460
That prosthesis of yours is well-crafted.

02:22.990 --> 02:24.390
You have keen eyes.

02:25.150 --> 02:26.579
This is a gift from heaven.

02:32.670 --> 02:33.630
What a waste.

02:35.550 --> 02:36.350
Alright.

02:36.510 --> 02:37.670
Hurry up and eat.

02:37.780 --> 02:38.790
The food is getting cold.

02:39.590 --> 02:40.910
Master, you should eat more too.

02:57.870 --> 02:58.990
Master, please have some tea.

03:01.820 --> 03:02.750
Is that guy the one

03:02.830 --> 03:04.150
you've been looking for?

03:04.310 --> 03:05.110
Yes.

03:06.350 --> 03:07.430
Who is he,

03:07.900 --> 03:09.470
to have the God of Craft

03:09.590 --> 03:10.630
personally serve him?

03:10.950 --> 03:11.990
He's Yuanzhong,

03:12.110 --> 03:13.550
the High Priest of the Youhu Clan.

03:13.880 --> 03:15.600
I chose to serve him of my own will.

03:17.350 --> 03:19.310
This man's vitality is depleted,

03:19.510 --> 03:21.920
having the look of someone with a short life span.

03:23.790 --> 03:25.060
He's not very good with words,

03:25.150 --> 03:27.150
and sometimes he can be quick-tempered.

03:27.230 --> 03:29.190
But he's a good person.

03:29.590 --> 03:30.540
There are certain reasons

03:30.579 --> 03:31.910
for his poor health.

03:32.150 --> 03:34.000
Master, please don't speak of him like that.

03:35.210 --> 03:36.240
It's all because of

03:36.430 --> 03:37.910
that prosthesis you made, isn't it?

03:43.950 --> 03:44.910
You're already a god.

03:44.910 --> 03:46.740
What you create is naturally extraordinary.

03:47.790 --> 03:50.070
Is this why you descended to the mortal world?

03:51.270 --> 03:52.630
Master, could you please not ask

03:53.110 --> 03:54.590
such dangerous questions?

03:54.950 --> 03:56.510
I can't answer that.

04:00.510 --> 04:01.310
Oh, right.

04:01.950 --> 04:03.180
Was it you who set up

04:03.180 --> 04:04.710
the restriction on the mountain?

04:05.680 --> 04:06.430
That's great.

04:06.430 --> 04:07.790
Can you temporarily remove

04:07.790 --> 04:08.910
the restriction here?

04:08.910 --> 04:09.620
Why?

04:09.870 --> 04:11.470
Because a weapon spirit of Yuanzhong

04:11.470 --> 04:13.140
is sealed at the formation's core here.

04:13.230 --> 04:14.900
To break the seal,

04:14.900 --> 04:15.950
we must first

04:15.950 --> 04:17.149
remove your restriction.

04:17.640 --> 04:19.630
Why should I care about his affairs?

04:21.390 --> 04:22.710
Since this reckless weapon spirit

04:22.710 --> 04:24.190
dared to enter my restriction,

04:24.550 --> 04:25.950
it won't leave easily.

04:28.470 --> 04:29.350
You solved

04:29.950 --> 04:30.790
the first problem?

04:31.710 --> 04:32.950
I should solve the second one now.

04:38.270 --> 04:39.470
Master, where are you

04:39.710 --> 04:40.940
planning to go next?

04:41.270 --> 04:42.110
I'm not planning...

04:44.670 --> 04:45.590
to go anywhere.

04:45.659 --> 04:47.350
I'm going to stay here for a few days.

04:50.510 --> 04:51.750
He took my room.

04:52.860 --> 04:53.909
So where should I sleep?

05:30.070 --> 05:30.990
What are you doing?

05:31.430 --> 05:32.190
Master is going to

05:32.190 --> 05:33.230
stay here for a while.

05:33.230 --> 05:34.070
So I gave him

05:34.070 --> 05:35.030
my room.

05:36.590 --> 05:37.830
It's very cold in the mountains at night.

05:37.950 --> 05:39.150
How can you sleep here?

05:39.670 --> 05:40.540
It's fine.

05:40.540 --> 05:41.470
I won't sleep.

05:41.470 --> 05:42.870
I'll meditate here all night,

05:42.870 --> 05:44.630
and the night will pass quickly.

05:46.830 --> 05:47.630
Whatever.

06:26.630 --> 06:27.430
Why are you here?

06:29.060 --> 06:30.150
The side room was taken.

06:30.150 --> 06:31.680
I gave my room to Ji Tanyin.

06:31.750 --> 06:32.670
I'll sleep here from now on.

06:34.790 --> 06:36.150
Wait, Yuanzhong.

06:36.550 --> 06:37.950
Don't you think there's something...

06:38.830 --> 06:39.909
inappropriate between them?

06:40.920 --> 06:41.790
It doesn't seem wrong to me.

06:41.870 --> 06:42.710
What's inappropriate about them?

06:43.470 --> 06:44.790
It's not that simple.

06:44.870 --> 06:46.510
Ji Tanyin is clearly a sincere,

06:46.510 --> 06:47.940
good girl.

06:48.270 --> 06:49.590
Be careful she gets sweet-talked away

06:49.590 --> 06:50.590
by that old man.

06:51.470 --> 06:52.270
They are just a normal

06:52.270 --> 06:53.190
master and disciple.

06:53.190 --> 06:54.070
You're overthinking it.

06:54.400 --> 06:55.520
So what?

06:55.630 --> 06:56.630
Didn't that Immortal Qingsong

06:56.630 --> 06:57.270
marry

06:57.270 --> 06:58.390
his own disciple?

06:59.550 --> 07:00.350
Yuanzhong,

07:01.030 --> 07:02.540
I think you should...

07:02.540 --> 07:03.430
Shut up and go to sleep.

07:06.710 --> 07:07.510
You're right.

07:07.790 --> 07:08.670
You're not worried.

07:08.670 --> 07:09.730
So why should I be?

07:51.230 --> 07:52.670
Miss Ji's master

07:52.700 --> 07:54.320
is really quite fortunate.

07:55.870 --> 07:57.310
What gives him the right to live here?

07:58.409 --> 07:59.550
To be precise,

07:59.550 --> 08:00.800
this is his territory.

08:00.830 --> 08:02.070
We are the ones who came later.

08:05.180 --> 08:06.860
Master, did you sleep well last night?

08:07.030 --> 08:07.820
It was alright.

08:09.270 --> 08:11.230
Are you going to solve problems today?

08:12.870 --> 08:13.680
No, I'm not.

08:13.790 --> 08:15.150
It's rare to see you.

08:15.350 --> 08:16.630
Over these years, I've accumulated

08:16.630 --> 08:18.350
many unsolved problems

08:18.350 --> 08:19.630
I'd like to ask you about.

08:27.230 --> 08:28.550
You're already a god.

08:28.550 --> 08:29.830
You don't need to ask me, do you?

08:30.230 --> 08:31.310
The sea of knowledge is boundless.

08:31.560 --> 08:33.559
There will always be unsolved problems.

08:33.710 --> 08:34.669
Just like in the Mortal Realm,

08:34.750 --> 08:36.150
there are many people who are no less capable

08:36.150 --> 08:37.350
than those in the Divine Realm.

08:38.549 --> 08:39.470
Like who?

08:39.990 --> 08:41.190
Like you,

08:41.659 --> 08:43.510
and... and Yuanzhong.

08:43.669 --> 08:44.480
Him?

08:45.910 --> 08:46.910
What's so good about him?

08:47.350 --> 08:48.150
Well...

08:48.550 --> 08:49.870
He's kind, righteous,

08:50.270 --> 08:51.390
resilient,

08:51.710 --> 08:52.910
and has a big heart.

08:52.910 --> 08:53.990
Just because he said this house is his,

08:53.990 --> 08:54.830
does that make it his?

08:54.830 --> 08:55.790
Who authorized that?

08:55.820 --> 08:57.070
Did he show you the deed?

08:57.390 --> 08:58.310
By that logic,

08:58.310 --> 08:58.870
the paths he's walked

08:58.870 --> 08:59.950
would also be his.

09:02.310 --> 09:03.910
Everything is a gift from heaven.

09:03.910 --> 09:05.260
We are all just travelers in this world,

09:05.260 --> 09:06.710
so what difference does it make who came first?

09:09.910 --> 09:11.030
I can tell

09:11.350 --> 09:12.150
that he's not as strong

09:12.150 --> 09:13.790
as he appears.

09:14.500 --> 09:17.070
Over these years, he has endured a lot of injustice

09:17.350 --> 09:18.540
and suffered greatly.

09:19.270 --> 09:20.470
But even so,

09:20.750 --> 09:22.150
after he was unsealed,

09:22.150 --> 09:23.590
he didn't take his anger out on others.

09:24.030 --> 09:25.080
A quality like that

09:25.080 --> 09:26.990
is rare anywhere.

09:28.190 --> 09:28.990
Tanyin,

09:29.750 --> 09:31.030
I have a question.

09:31.030 --> 09:32.150
Answer truthfully.

09:33.140 --> 09:34.190
Yes, Master.

09:36.110 --> 09:37.310
Do you like him?

09:40.070 --> 09:40.870
No.

09:42.190 --> 09:43.630
I can't like him.

09:44.350 --> 09:45.190
Is it that you can't like him,

09:45.790 --> 09:46.910
or that you don't?

09:52.900 --> 09:53.830
I don't know

09:53.830 --> 09:55.270
why you're staying by his side,

09:55.510 --> 09:57.350
but I can guess the reason.

09:57.990 --> 09:59.080
Although you're a god now,

09:59.080 --> 10:00.670
you still have a pure heart

10:00.710 --> 10:03.310
and haven't fully grasped the ways of the world.

10:05.240 --> 10:07.270
I've lived over 1000 years in this world

10:07.510 --> 10:09.470
and can read people pretty accurately.

10:09.950 --> 10:12.260
In this world, some people

10:12.260 --> 10:13.710
like to keep things harmonious,

10:13.990 --> 10:15.620
believing that friendships should be as light as water.

10:16.190 --> 10:17.150
But some people

10:17.190 --> 10:18.470
fight to the death

10:18.470 --> 10:19.510
to seek a clear result.

10:20.390 --> 10:21.590
The High Priest is the kind of person who,

10:22.590 --> 10:24.030
knowing there's a tiger on the mountain,

10:24.030 --> 10:25.630
still heads straight toward it.

10:26.510 --> 10:28.070
He bears a heavy burden

10:28.540 --> 10:30.270
and has too many things he must do.

10:32.230 --> 10:33.070
Remember,

10:33.590 --> 10:35.030
no matter what your intentions are,

10:35.270 --> 10:36.310
don't try to figure him out

10:36.310 --> 10:37.360
with your logic.

10:38.390 --> 10:39.550
Because you won't be able to

10:40.070 --> 10:41.510
see through a person like him.

10:50.350 --> 10:51.790
No matter what your intentions are,

10:51.910 --> 10:52.990
don't try to figure him out

10:52.990 --> 10:53.990
with your logic.

10:55.080 --> 10:56.190
Because you won't be able to

10:56.950 --> 10:58.390
see through a person like him.

11:27.510 --> 11:29.030
What trick is it this time?

11:30.870 --> 11:31.830
There are words on the door.

11:38.430 --> 11:41.380
"Taixuan Scriptures says, 'Xuan gives birth to all things.

11:41.380 --> 11:44.190
All returns to one, following the way of nature.'

11:44.460 --> 11:47.910
Therefore, the system of heaven operates in an infinite, cyclical pattern."

11:48.790 --> 11:50.020
What is all this nonsense?

11:50.020 --> 11:51.310
It's like a heavenly book.

11:51.390 --> 11:52.630
This is a treatise.

11:52.980 --> 11:54.080
The question is over here.

11:57.910 --> 11:59.710
"One should know that all things have spirits,

11:59.710 --> 12:01.270
yet only the 'white horse' remains.

12:01.620 --> 12:03.300
Or perhaps all things lack wisdom,

12:03.350 --> 12:04.870
and only the 'white horse' possesses it."

12:06.020 --> 12:07.490
This seems to refer to...

12:08.310 --> 12:09.630
The old saying, "Like a white horse passing through a crevice."

12:09.950 --> 12:11.150
It's talking about time.

12:12.110 --> 12:12.830
I think I know

12:12.830 --> 12:14.110
how to solve this problem now.

12:16.140 --> 12:17.270
It also says

12:17.510 --> 12:19.190
to wait quietly in the inner room

12:19.190 --> 12:20.830
until the incense burns out.

12:22.340 --> 12:23.720
That should be referring to this.

12:27.780 --> 12:28.830
The inner room...

12:31.620 --> 12:32.540
The door isn't locked.

12:32.630 --> 12:33.380
Let's go in.

12:33.380 --> 12:34.150
Wait a moment.

12:34.590 --> 12:36.310
I'll go in alone for this one.

12:37.310 --> 12:38.100
Why?

12:38.100 --> 12:39.550
Because only one person is needed.

12:39.550 --> 12:40.790
If you come in with me,

12:40.790 --> 12:41.910
it'll ruin my plan.

12:44.670 --> 12:46.350
Everyone has their strengths and weaknesses.

12:46.350 --> 12:47.790
This isn't something you're good at.

12:47.790 --> 12:49.350
Besides, this is just solving a problem.

12:49.350 --> 12:50.350
If I can't solve it,

12:50.350 --> 12:51.710
I'll naturally come back out the same way.

12:51.900 --> 12:53.550
This is a restriction set by my master.

12:53.550 --> 12:54.710
He won't harm me.

12:55.110 --> 12:56.280
Just wait for me here,

12:56.320 --> 12:57.550
and I'll be out once I'm done.

14:20.030 --> 14:20.830
Sir,

14:21.270 --> 14:22.230
I received the message

14:22.230 --> 14:23.350
and rushed here overnight.

14:23.430 --> 14:24.590
But the journey was long.

14:24.590 --> 14:25.830
I'm sorry for keeping you waiting.

14:27.310 --> 14:28.110
It's alright.

14:30.670 --> 14:31.910
Thank you for your understanding, Sir.

14:33.390 --> 14:34.710
It's rare to find such a quiet place.

14:35.310 --> 14:36.830
It gives me a chance to think about some things.

14:37.620 --> 14:39.230
Have you found the High Priest's whereabouts?

14:39.470 --> 14:40.270
Yes, we have.

14:40.590 --> 14:41.350
Someone saw

14:41.370 --> 14:42.870
the High Priest heading to Baitou Mountain.

14:42.910 --> 14:44.350
That's Lord Mei Shan's territory,

14:44.710 --> 14:45.510
and he happens to be

14:45.510 --> 14:46.950
a friend of the High Priest.

14:47.250 --> 14:48.280
I suspect

14:48.350 --> 14:50.470
that Baitou Mountain is likely

14:50.470 --> 14:51.590
where the other four weapon spirits

14:51.590 --> 14:52.590
are sealed.

14:53.830 --> 14:54.950
Baitou Mountain?

14:56.870 --> 14:58.150
I'll make a trip to Baitou Mountain.

14:58.350 --> 14:59.750
Go to Yandu and wait for me there.

15:01.030 --> 15:01.700
Yes.

15:25.750 --> 15:26.950
I didn't expect that, inside here...

15:28.020 --> 15:28.830
Don't!

15:32.630 --> 15:33.440
This door...

15:33.630 --> 15:34.550
It's gone.

15:35.700 --> 15:36.910
Why?

15:36.960 --> 15:37.870
Because it's a door

15:37.870 --> 15:38.470
that can only be opened

15:38.470 --> 15:39.600
from the outside.

15:41.030 --> 15:42.590
So doesn't that mean we're trapped here?

15:42.880 --> 15:44.010
Not necessarily.

15:44.040 --> 15:45.000
Once the incense burns out,

15:45.020 --> 15:46.810
the door will reappear.

15:48.470 --> 15:49.550
Then why are you so nervous?

15:49.670 --> 15:50.830
It's just the time it takes for one incense stick to burn out.

15:50.830 --> 15:52.150
I'll wait here with you.

15:52.630 --> 15:53.830
Who asked you to accompany me?

15:53.830 --> 15:54.830
I told you not to come in.

15:54.830 --> 15:56.320
Why didn't you listen to me?

15:57.270 --> 15:58.030
I've already said

15:58.030 --> 15:59.380
I wouldn't be in danger

16:00.110 --> 16:01.030
and told you not to come in.

16:01.030 --> 16:01.550
It's just the time it takes

16:01.550 --> 16:02.390
for one incense stick to burn out.

16:02.390 --> 16:03.710
Why did you have to follow me in?

16:03.750 --> 16:05.430
Since you said there's no danger

16:05.470 --> 16:06.830
and it's only a short while,

16:07.110 --> 16:08.350
why didn't you let me in?

16:09.870 --> 16:10.670
Ji Tanyin,

16:11.380 --> 16:13.030
you need to understand one thing—

16:13.390 --> 16:14.670
I'm the one who needs to break the seal.

16:14.670 --> 16:15.830
This is my business.

16:16.470 --> 16:17.270
You are just

16:17.270 --> 16:18.830
my maid.

16:18.990 --> 16:19.940
I have no habit

16:19.940 --> 16:21.790
of letting women fight my battles for me.

16:25.270 --> 16:26.230
Are you still not going to tell me the truth?

16:29.630 --> 16:30.430
Forget it.

16:30.450 --> 16:31.470
Since you've come in,

16:31.470 --> 16:32.670
I can't hide it from you anymore.

16:33.070 --> 16:34.590
Look at the environment here.

16:35.190 --> 16:37.430
The environment here is completely different from the outside world.

16:37.750 --> 16:39.710
This place is called the Realm of the White Horse.

16:41.070 --> 16:42.030
The Realm of the White Horse?

16:42.070 --> 16:42.870
That's right.

16:43.190 --> 16:45.310
It is an illusionary space created by the caster

16:45.310 --> 16:47.020
using a mind technique.

16:47.020 --> 16:48.360
The flow of time in this realm

16:48.360 --> 16:50.350
is completely different from the outside world.

16:50.740 --> 16:51.660
How is it different?

16:51.710 --> 16:52.830
It's much slower.

16:52.910 --> 16:54.030
Once, when I was in the cold...

16:57.550 --> 16:59.310
I... I once encountered

16:59.670 --> 17:01.350
a similar predicament.

17:01.430 --> 17:02.120
Though outside,

17:02.120 --> 17:03.510
only 30 minutes passed,

17:03.510 --> 17:04.430
inside,

17:04.430 --> 17:05.869
many years had already passed.

17:06.109 --> 17:06.990
Many years?

17:07.470 --> 17:08.260
Yes.

17:08.390 --> 17:09.109
That's why I told you

17:09.109 --> 17:10.150
not to come in.

17:10.270 --> 17:11.589
I've already been through it,

17:11.589 --> 17:13.069
so I know how to break out of it.

17:13.790 --> 17:15.069
But there's nothing here.

17:15.300 --> 17:16.270
For over a decade,

17:16.270 --> 17:17.630
didn't you eat or drink anything?

17:17.750 --> 17:18.750
Not exactly.

17:19.190 --> 17:20.160
The constraint of emptiness

17:20.160 --> 17:22.150
mainly confines the mind and spirit.

17:22.230 --> 17:23.430
Even without food or water,

17:23.430 --> 17:24.589
you won't feel hunger,

17:24.589 --> 17:25.950
nor will you feel tired.

17:26.470 --> 17:27.790
Actually, even breathing

17:27.790 --> 17:28.980
is unnecessary.

17:29.030 --> 17:30.030
Haven't you noticed

17:30.030 --> 17:30.990
that there's no air

17:30.990 --> 17:32.150
to breathe here at all?

17:35.540 --> 17:36.590
Indeed.

17:37.670 --> 17:39.500
That Xie is quite something.

17:40.030 --> 17:41.230
My master is knowledgeable.

17:41.230 --> 17:43.070
You're surprised because you've seen little.

17:44.670 --> 17:45.470
Fine.

17:45.910 --> 17:47.310
I admit that you and your master are impressive.

17:47.350 --> 17:48.950
You're impressive, and he's even more so.

17:49.180 --> 17:49.990
Satisfied now?

17:50.390 --> 17:51.150
Since you already know

17:51.150 --> 17:52.310
how to break it,

17:52.430 --> 17:53.670
stop keeping it to yourself.

17:53.750 --> 17:54.550
Please, go ahead.

18:01.710 --> 18:02.500
What are these?

18:02.900 --> 18:03.990
The lines must be drawn straight,

18:04.150 --> 18:05.230
crisscrossed.

18:05.270 --> 18:07.110
The sizes of the squares must be consistent.

18:08.680 --> 18:10.150
I'll draw the horizontal lines, and you draw the vertical ones.

18:10.150 --> 18:10.950
Got it?

18:54.590 --> 18:56.230
This line isn't straight.

19:11.630 --> 19:12.710
Is this better?

19:13.670 --> 19:15.830
The horizontal and vertical lines are aligned, and the squares are neat.

19:15.990 --> 19:17.430
That's good. Excellent.

19:17.950 --> 19:18.750
Here, take it back.

19:19.430 --> 19:20.430
Why are you giving it to me?

19:20.550 --> 19:21.870
You still need to use it.

19:22.750 --> 19:23.550
What do you mean?

19:24.390 --> 19:25.990
I'll draw Xs, and you draw Os.

19:32.580 --> 19:33.400
It's your turn.

19:34.630 --> 19:37.510
You did all this just to play chess?

19:38.630 --> 19:39.430
Yes.

19:39.790 --> 19:41.550
Playing chess is the best way to pass the time.

19:41.990 --> 19:43.430
Is this your way to break the formation?

20:04.830 --> 20:05.790
What are you doing?

20:06.710 --> 20:07.510
Checking my pulse.

20:07.910 --> 20:08.720
Checking your pulse?

20:09.310 --> 20:10.630
I'm timing it with my pulse.

20:12.390 --> 20:14.270
What's the timing for?

20:14.440 --> 20:15.740
To figure out how much time

20:16.470 --> 20:17.910
it takes you to make this move.

20:22.070 --> 20:22.910
This move

20:23.070 --> 20:23.950
took you the time

20:23.950 --> 20:25.710
of 21,800 heartbeats,

20:25.710 --> 20:26.630
which means

20:26.630 --> 20:28.750
you spent six hours on it.

20:28.750 --> 20:30.070
We have plenty of time.

20:30.070 --> 20:31.830
Isn't it better to play slowly?

20:35.230 --> 20:35.910
Last time,

20:35.910 --> 20:37.390
when I played chess against myself,

20:37.630 --> 20:38.830
I often spent 10 or more days

20:38.830 --> 20:40.030
on a single game.

20:40.270 --> 20:41.310
Today, considering you,

20:41.310 --> 20:42.310
I've sped it up.

20:44.390 --> 20:46.500
Playing chess slowly is really boring.

20:47.470 --> 20:49.350
Do you have any other ways

20:49.350 --> 20:50.430
to pass the time?

20:52.070 --> 20:52.870
Well...

20:53.750 --> 20:54.840
how about drinking?

20:55.070 --> 20:55.870
You have wine?

20:55.950 --> 20:56.750
Yes.

20:57.070 --> 20:58.190
But there's only one jar.

20:58.310 --> 20:59.910
It was a gift from Xue when we were

20:59.910 --> 21:01.110
on the tower ship last time.

21:02.060 --> 21:03.400
Well, it's better than nothing.

21:04.110 --> 21:04.950
Bring it out then.

21:11.150 --> 21:12.140
There's only one cup?

21:12.640 --> 21:14.470
High Priest, if you don't like it,

21:15.110 --> 21:16.660
you can just drink straight from the jar.

21:16.860 --> 21:17.870
The wine is so little.

21:17.920 --> 21:19.110
We'll have to drink it slowly.

21:20.590 --> 21:21.830
How about we play a drinking game?

21:22.990 --> 21:24.670
But I don't know how to play drinking games.

21:25.750 --> 21:26.630
It's not difficult.

21:26.830 --> 21:28.630
There are countless drinking games.

21:28.750 --> 21:30.470
Have you ever played "Never Have I Ever"?

21:30.950 --> 21:31.830
What's that?

21:32.270 --> 21:33.150
It's very simple.

21:33.430 --> 21:34.390
You say one thing

21:34.390 --> 21:35.710
you've never done.

21:35.710 --> 21:36.990
If I never did it either,

21:36.990 --> 21:38.110
then you lose.

21:38.110 --> 21:39.070
The loser drinks.

21:39.190 --> 21:40.110
No matter whether you win or lose,

21:40.270 --> 21:41.270
the other person gets to set the next challenge.

21:41.270 --> 21:43.310
But you need to start whatever you say

21:43.310 --> 21:45.430
with "Never have I ever."

21:45.430 --> 21:46.390
Got it?

21:47.590 --> 21:48.910
It doesn't seem too difficult.

21:49.390 --> 21:51.070
You'll get it after one round. You go first.

21:53.710 --> 21:54.510
Well...

21:57.200 --> 21:58.430
Never have I ever stolen anything.

22:01.430 --> 22:02.550
Such a boring challenge.

22:04.110 --> 22:05.150
But you won.

22:06.010 --> 22:07.040
I won?

22:08.340 --> 22:09.700
So you've stolen things?

22:10.230 --> 22:11.310
What did you steal?

22:11.630 --> 22:12.430
Many things.

22:13.110 --> 22:15.550
When I was young, I stole my father's wine,

22:16.190 --> 22:17.630
my teacher's exam papers,

22:18.300 --> 22:19.710
and Tanghua's boots.

22:19.790 --> 22:21.400
As I grew up, I stole even more.

22:21.950 --> 22:23.580
I stole the fame that didn't belong to me,

22:23.990 --> 22:25.430
power that wasn't mine,

22:26.590 --> 22:27.470
and...

22:30.110 --> 22:31.230
I stole many lives.

22:32.590 --> 22:33.710
How much wine should I drink?

22:33.910 --> 22:35.070
It doesn't work like that.

22:37.340 --> 22:40.230
But I did steal Tanghua's boots.

22:46.630 --> 22:47.420
My turn.

22:48.750 --> 22:51.880
Never have I ever lied to a friend.

22:53.550 --> 22:54.390
You're lying.

22:55.100 --> 22:56.290
Last time,

22:56.310 --> 22:58.190
you asked me to go to Penglai Alley in Shifang Town

22:58.190 --> 22:59.710
to find a Mr. Bai.

23:00.070 --> 23:01.190
But there's no such place

23:01.190 --> 23:02.390
as Penglai Alley in Shifang Town,

23:02.390 --> 23:03.950
let alone a Mr. Bai.

23:03.950 --> 23:05.310
So, are you my friend?

23:07.910 --> 23:09.020
I think I am.

23:11.590 --> 23:12.870
Then have you ever lied to me?

23:25.070 --> 23:26.470
Seems like you're not so honest either.

23:29.460 --> 23:31.110
Never have I ever done anything I feel guilty about.

23:31.550 --> 23:32.790
What do you consider as something to feel guilty about?

23:33.230 --> 23:35.030
Things that make you feel ashamed,

23:35.190 --> 23:36.230
guilty, go against your conscience,

23:36.310 --> 23:37.580
and self-loathing.

23:38.990 --> 23:39.960
Well, I haven't done that either.

23:42.510 --> 23:43.590
You really haven't.

23:57.190 --> 23:58.350
Never have I ever

24:00.150 --> 24:01.510
approached someone

24:01.510 --> 24:02.870
with ill intentions.

24:17.510 --> 24:19.430
What counts as ill intentions?

24:19.460 --> 24:20.380
Does that need to be asked?

24:21.630 --> 24:23.310
Doing evil deeds, having malicious thoughts,

24:23.580 --> 24:25.220
scheming, calculating—

24:25.350 --> 24:26.260
they all count.

24:28.270 --> 24:29.590
What if such ill intentions

24:30.030 --> 24:31.150
are considered

24:31.150 --> 24:32.420
a kind of good for the world?

24:48.750 --> 24:50.350
If it's for the benefit of the world,

24:51.110 --> 24:52.340
be called an ill intention.

24:53.680 --> 24:54.470
Alright.

24:55.270 --> 24:56.740
Then this drink is yours.

24:59.790 --> 25:00.590
Alright.

25:07.070 --> 25:08.580
Never have I ever lost my true self.

25:08.990 --> 25:09.990
What's true self?

25:11.310 --> 25:12.350
Unconstrained,

25:12.350 --> 25:13.350
free of resentment or hatred,

25:13.430 --> 25:14.390
at ease,

25:14.750 --> 25:16.310
and never swayed

25:16.310 --> 25:17.510
by outside influences—

25:17.510 --> 25:18.550
that is the true self.

25:23.310 --> 25:24.790
Then you're really lucky.

25:32.750 --> 25:33.550
There's not much wine left.

25:57.060 --> 26:00.330
Never have I ever had a crush.

26:05.470 --> 26:07.230
What? You have?

26:09.270 --> 26:10.070
I...

26:11.680 --> 26:13.030
It's either yes or no.

26:13.030 --> 26:14.430
Why are you hesitating?

26:18.910 --> 26:21.990
How do you define a crush?

26:24.070 --> 26:27.990
It's someone you care about, pay attention to, and admire.

26:28.230 --> 26:29.350
You can't help

26:29.820 --> 26:31.070
but want to care for her,

26:31.160 --> 26:33.670
and you can't control the urge to see her

26:33.700 --> 26:34.970
and be with her.

26:35.470 --> 26:36.550
Sometimes,

26:36.750 --> 26:38.150
you even forget who you are,

26:38.550 --> 26:39.460
like...

26:40.550 --> 26:41.870
like being drunk.

26:44.470 --> 26:46.380
What? Have you experienced this?

26:46.490 --> 26:47.350
I...

26:50.710 --> 26:51.980
Why are you looking at me?

26:53.470 --> 26:54.670
I don't know.

26:55.030 --> 26:56.430
I can't explain it.

27:12.030 --> 27:13.060
I'll just drink half a cup.

27:17.440 --> 27:18.610
Why did you drink too?

27:19.150 --> 27:19.950
I'm done playing.

27:20.230 --> 27:21.030
Why?

27:21.240 --> 27:22.120
What do you mean "why"?

27:22.150 --> 27:23.350
I'm bored. I don't want to play anymore.

27:24.230 --> 27:25.230
You're lying.

27:25.350 --> 27:26.230
Who's lying?

27:26.230 --> 27:26.990
You are.

27:27.400 --> 27:28.160
You're telling a lie.

27:28.180 --> 27:29.510
That's lying.

27:29.520 --> 27:31.010
What's true and what's false?

27:31.190 --> 27:32.190
Can you tell the difference?

27:33.030 --> 27:33.740
The longer you live,

27:33.740 --> 27:34.900
the more you understand one thing:

27:35.050 --> 27:36.450
it's hard to tell what's true or false in this world.

27:36.670 --> 27:37.670
Is the sky real?

27:37.690 --> 27:38.650
Is the earth real?

27:38.990 --> 27:40.310
What's real

27:40.430 --> 27:41.680
in this space?

27:44.670 --> 27:46.150
In this space, it seems true

27:47.070 --> 27:48.590
that there's nothing real

27:49.110 --> 27:50.870
except for you and me.

27:50.890 --> 27:52.500
Are we real?

27:54.310 --> 27:55.270
Doesn't the real us

27:56.070 --> 27:57.590
need to breathe?

28:03.480 --> 28:04.750
I know how to get out now.

28:10.190 --> 28:11.230
The incense has burned out?

28:11.590 --> 28:12.630
We've passed this challenge?

28:12.900 --> 28:14.630
That's right. We're out.

28:19.580 --> 28:20.430
Looks like this is the entrance

28:20.430 --> 28:21.470
to the next challenge.

28:21.510 --> 28:22.310
Let's go.

28:24.600 --> 28:25.390
Wait.

28:25.550 --> 28:26.790
What's really going on?

28:27.150 --> 28:28.510
I still don't quite understand.

28:29.910 --> 28:31.230
Haven't you figured it out yet?

28:31.790 --> 28:33.110
Creating a space out of nothing

28:33.110 --> 28:34.350
is beyond the ability of ordinary people.

28:34.470 --> 28:35.790
Even if your master is incredibly formidable,

28:35.790 --> 28:37.150
he doesn't have such an ability.

28:37.710 --> 28:38.870
This so-called "Realm of the White Horse"

28:38.870 --> 28:39.950
is just an illusion.

28:40.190 --> 28:41.200
What it can trap

28:41.200 --> 28:42.910
is only our consciousness.

28:43.670 --> 28:45.990
Then why is the time inside

28:46.110 --> 28:47.590
different from the time outside?

28:47.950 --> 28:49.750
Time doesn't actually exist.

28:49.790 --> 28:50.710
It's all an illusion.

28:51.550 --> 28:52.670
Time doesn't exist?

28:53.510 --> 28:55.270
Ji Tanyin, then tell me,

28:55.580 --> 28:56.630
what is time?

28:59.670 --> 29:00.590
Time, in its essence,

29:00.990 --> 29:02.270
can be as grand as the rise and set of the sun,

29:02.390 --> 29:03.430
the movement of the stars,

29:03.740 --> 29:05.270
or as minute as the falling of incense ash or sand,

29:05.430 --> 29:06.430
the shifting shadow of a sundial.

29:06.470 --> 29:08.310
I've even heard that

29:08.330 --> 29:10.210
in the Western Region, there are master craftsmen

29:10.270 --> 29:11.470
who can create timekeeping devices

29:11.470 --> 29:12.870
using metal gears,

29:12.910 --> 29:15.030
precise enough to measure the tiniest movements of time

29:15.050 --> 29:16.210
with almost no deviation.

29:17.190 --> 29:18.870
But actually, no matter the method,

29:19.160 --> 29:20.230
it's just measuring

29:20.230 --> 29:22.110
one object's movement

29:22.110 --> 29:23.670
in relation to another.

29:24.030 --> 29:26.070
It's simply using motion to measure motion.

29:26.150 --> 29:27.710
So, there's no such thing as time.

29:28.700 --> 29:29.950
I'm even more confused now.

29:31.160 --> 29:32.510
Let me put it more simply.

29:32.790 --> 29:34.150
The essence of time

29:34.150 --> 29:35.540
is just a consensus

29:35.540 --> 29:37.110
made by all beings in the world,

29:37.110 --> 29:38.230
a common agreement

29:38.230 --> 29:39.470
for coordinated labor.

29:39.990 --> 29:40.750
A day

29:40.750 --> 29:42.310
can be divided into 12 periods,

29:42.310 --> 29:43.750
but it can also be divided

29:43.750 --> 29:45.190
into 24, 48,

29:45.190 --> 29:46.230
or even countless ones.

29:46.230 --> 29:47.630
As long as everyone in the world accepts it,

29:47.630 --> 29:48.590
the number of divisions

29:48.590 --> 29:49.750
doesn't really matter.

29:49.990 --> 29:51.510
In fact, time has never changed.

29:51.510 --> 29:52.510
What we can truly possess

29:52.510 --> 29:53.870
is only one time,

29:54.190 --> 29:55.180
and that is the present moment,

29:55.180 --> 29:56.150
right here and now.

29:56.790 --> 29:58.880
Did you come up with all of this just now?

29:58.910 --> 30:00.230
It's not that hard to understand.

30:00.430 --> 30:02.430
As long as you know that time is an illusion

30:02.430 --> 30:03.870
and doesn't really exist,

30:04.110 --> 30:05.310
then the Realm of the White Horse

30:05.310 --> 30:07.150
is just a trick,

30:07.150 --> 30:07.990
a form of hypnosis.

30:07.990 --> 30:09.340
As long as you truly don't believe it in your heart,

30:09.340 --> 30:10.910
why do you need to sit for 10 years doing nothing?

30:11.100 --> 30:12.350
Unexpectedly, once I tried,

30:12.830 --> 30:13.630
we got out.

30:15.230 --> 30:16.480
Your comprehension is extraordinary.

30:16.650 --> 30:19.060
It seems I've underestimated you before.

30:21.710 --> 30:22.950
I'm serious.

30:23.150 --> 30:23.940
I got it.

30:58.150 --> 30:59.110
Braised pork?

30:59.790 --> 31:00.710
What are these?

31:01.480 --> 31:02.470
These are words.

31:03.630 --> 31:04.870
Of course I know they're words.

31:06.750 --> 31:07.630
What are those?

31:09.350 --> 31:10.670
Those are the ink and brush for writing.

31:11.070 --> 31:12.570
How strange.

31:12.710 --> 31:13.110
Don't tell me

31:13.110 --> 31:14.390
that we're supposed to practice calligraphy here.

31:15.190 --> 31:16.740
Not you. Me.

31:17.390 --> 31:19.030
I wrote all these words.

31:19.390 --> 31:20.870
I wrote them here years ago.

31:21.590 --> 31:22.390
Braised pork?

31:22.870 --> 31:23.910
It's "braised pork,"

31:23.950 --> 31:25.070
and also a calming mantra.

31:26.590 --> 31:28.750
It was my 10th year in the mountains.

31:29.150 --> 31:30.020
For a whole year,

31:30.230 --> 31:31.550
I was trapped here

31:31.550 --> 31:32.590
by the third question,

31:32.590 --> 31:33.950
unable to pass it.

31:41.570 --> 31:44.510
[Teenage Ji Tanyin]
[Human Race]

31:43.980 --> 31:44.890
I understand now.

32:04.230 --> 32:07.830
Reach to the farthest corners in all directions,

32:08.030 --> 32:11.870
immeasurably high, unfathomably deep.

32:12.040 --> 32:16.090
It envelops the world, bestowing essence upon all things in an invisible manner.

32:16.120 --> 32:20.160
It flows like a spring, rushing and gradually filling.

32:20.180 --> 32:24.530
It churns and stirs, muddy yet slowly becoming clear.

32:24.750 --> 32:28.420
Vertically, it extends to the entire universe;

32:28.460 --> 32:30.660
horizontally, it covers everything.

32:30.680 --> 32:31.600
Wrong.

32:40.240 --> 32:41.030
Master,

32:45.790 --> 32:47.380
I was frustrated by the problem.

32:48.010 --> 32:49.450
I've embarrassed myself in front of you.

32:50.450 --> 32:51.740
You're agitated.

32:52.430 --> 32:53.830
How are you going to solve the problem like this?

32:54.270 --> 32:56.350
But every time I try to focus,

32:58.220 --> 32:59.610
I can't calm my mind.

32:59.870 --> 33:01.750
Master, please teach me a calming mantra.

33:10.370 --> 33:11.690
Have you been reading too many storybooks?

33:11.790 --> 33:13.470
There's no such thing as a calming mantra in this world.

33:13.820 --> 33:14.740
There isn't?

33:14.790 --> 33:15.580
There isn't.

33:18.420 --> 33:19.620
But actually, there is.

33:20.750 --> 33:21.560
There is?

33:23.890 --> 33:25.000
Hold your breath and calm your mind,

33:25.030 --> 33:27.440
and everything in the world is a calming mantra.

33:27.870 --> 33:29.430
When I was your age,

33:29.430 --> 33:30.590
whenever I felt agitated,

33:30.590 --> 33:32.510
I would copy a book called The Book of Calming

33:32.520 --> 33:34.660
and I would naturally calm down.

33:35.990 --> 33:37.550
Then I'll find a book and start copying it.

33:39.000 --> 33:40.010
Silly child,

33:40.750 --> 33:42.100
you still don't understand what I'm saying?

33:42.310 --> 33:44.300
Then what should I do?

33:44.590 --> 33:46.430
Please stop speaking in riddles, Master.

33:47.710 --> 33:49.990
What do you like to eat?

33:51.070 --> 33:52.600
What do I like to eat?

33:54.270 --> 33:55.190
Braised pork.

33:55.190 --> 33:55.830
Good!

33:56.010 --> 33:57.610
Just copy the two words "braised pork."

33:58.140 --> 33:59.420
Focus your mind on it,

33:59.590 --> 34:00.270
and the effect of "braised pork"

34:00.270 --> 34:01.710
will be no different

34:01.720 --> 34:03.050
from that of The Book of Calming.

34:07.310 --> 34:08.110
So,

34:08.550 --> 34:09.270
you really copied

34:09.270 --> 34:10.389
"braised pork" countless times?

34:10.409 --> 34:11.520
It really worked.

34:13.310 --> 34:14.429
And this challenge...

34:15.360 --> 34:16.270
It's on the wall.

34:16.630 --> 34:17.790
Tear off these words,

34:17.790 --> 34:19.030
and you'll see it.

34:39.949 --> 34:41.179
It's really spectacular.

34:41.350 --> 34:42.150
Back then,

34:42.230 --> 34:44.070
my master only calculated the star chart for one domain,

34:44.150 --> 34:45.510
with just a few hundred stars.

34:46.350 --> 34:47.230
Now,

34:48.239 --> 34:49.360
roughly speaking,

34:49.750 --> 34:51.110
there are already about 1000 stars.

34:51.670 --> 34:52.350
I didn't expect

34:52.350 --> 34:54.030
that he really created the Star Map.

34:55.110 --> 34:55.909
What map?

34:56.139 --> 34:57.110
The Star Map.

34:57.430 --> 34:58.800
This map originated in the South Sea.

34:59.070 --> 35:00.270
It was originally a navigation map

35:00.270 --> 35:01.670
used by maritime vessels to determine their position.

35:01.950 --> 35:03.630
Although there are so many stars now,

35:03.950 --> 35:06.270
in the beginning, only a few dozen stars

35:06.270 --> 35:07.230
were truly calculated,

35:07.230 --> 35:08.390
with their movement patterns understood.

35:08.630 --> 35:09.790
Only a few dozen?

35:10.430 --> 35:11.470
What use is that?

35:11.470 --> 35:13.440
Don't underestimate those few dozen stars.

35:13.590 --> 35:15.750
The sea is vast and unpredictable.

35:15.870 --> 35:16.990
If you want to determine direction

35:16.990 --> 35:18.030
in navigation,

35:18.070 --> 35:18.990
nothing is more accurate

35:18.990 --> 35:20.230
than observing the stars.

35:20.230 --> 35:21.800
It is precisely because this knowledge

35:21.800 --> 35:22.830
was spread

35:22.870 --> 35:24.070
that humans

35:24.070 --> 35:25.510
could sail around the world

35:25.510 --> 35:26.270
and transport goods

35:26.270 --> 35:28.110
precisely between different regions,

35:28.310 --> 35:29.830
enabling people in the south to eat ginseng

35:29.950 --> 35:31.070
and people in the north to wear satin.

35:33.030 --> 35:34.510
Eating ginseng and wearing satin?

35:34.670 --> 35:35.550
That doesn't sound like

35:35.750 --> 35:37.870
something ordinary people would do.

35:38.060 --> 35:39.110
I know my master

35:39.110 --> 35:40.790
has been wanting to perfect the Star Map since his early years,

35:41.500 --> 35:42.590
but I thought 100 stars

35:42.590 --> 35:43.800
would be his limit.

35:43.800 --> 35:44.590
I never expected that

35:44.590 --> 35:45.670
over so many years,

35:45.670 --> 35:46.830
he never gave up

35:47.440 --> 35:50.060
and has expanded the Star Map to a thousand stars.

35:50.230 --> 35:51.840
If this map is widely spread,

35:52.280 --> 35:54.750
there will be no more boundaries in the world.

35:55.390 --> 35:56.710
From a hundred to a thousand?

35:57.230 --> 35:58.310
Does that mean the difficulty of solving this problem now

35:58.310 --> 35:59.320
is 10 times greater

35:59.320 --> 36:00.310
than it was for you back then?

36:00.380 --> 36:01.470
It's not just 10 times.

36:01.670 --> 36:02.670
For every additional 100 stars,

36:02.840 --> 36:03.830
the difficulty of solving it

36:03.950 --> 36:05.870
increases by dozens of times.

36:06.430 --> 36:07.220
I'm afraid

36:07.590 --> 36:08.390
that this problem can only be solved

36:08.390 --> 36:09.820
by someone who has navigated through the starry river,

36:10.030 --> 36:11.710
familiar with the position of each star

36:11.710 --> 36:12.790
in every domain.

36:13.190 --> 36:13.950
But where can we find

36:13.950 --> 36:15.190
such a person now?

36:19.030 --> 36:19.830
Ji Tanyin...

36:48.150 --> 36:49.070
I got it.

36:50.830 --> 36:52.350
Star Map contains four variations.

36:52.350 --> 36:53.470
Each variation ultimately

36:53.470 --> 36:55.470
leads to a digit.

36:55.910 --> 36:56.950
So, in the end,

36:57.230 --> 36:58.150
the answer we need to get

36:58.150 --> 36:59.190
is a four-digit number.

36:59.190 --> 36:59.950
Correct.

37:00.270 --> 37:01.350
Look at that door.

37:05.510 --> 37:06.320
I see.

37:18.790 --> 37:19.740
When you introduced it earlier,

37:19.740 --> 37:21.030
I thought it would be much more difficult.

37:21.060 --> 37:22.550
I thought I'd be trapped for another 10 years.

37:22.550 --> 37:23.630
It is difficult.

37:24.230 --> 37:25.150
I don't know why my master

37:25.150 --> 37:25.910
set

37:25.910 --> 37:26.910
such a hard problem.

37:27.100 --> 37:28.230
If it were someone else,

37:28.230 --> 37:29.470
10 years

37:29.470 --> 37:30.910
might not be enough for them to solve it.

37:32.350 --> 37:33.150
Got it.

37:33.430 --> 37:34.710
You're really impressive.

37:34.750 --> 37:35.510
Of course,

37:35.510 --> 37:36.750
there are things I don't understand either.

37:37.190 --> 37:38.100
For example,

37:38.100 --> 37:39.350
why are these four digits

37:40.110 --> 37:41.750
arranged in this particular order?

37:42.470 --> 37:43.430
No matter how I try,

37:43.430 --> 37:45.110
I can't figure out the meaning behind it.

37:45.910 --> 37:47.620
If you can't figure it out, then don't.

37:47.620 --> 37:49.270
We've passed it anyway. Let's move on to the next one.

38:08.370 --> 38:09.600
I know this thing.

38:11.190 --> 38:12.430
What is it called? Some kind of house?

38:12.710 --> 38:13.590
Linglong House.

38:13.670 --> 38:15.150
Right, Linglong House.

38:16.230 --> 38:17.030
You're familiar with it?

38:19.870 --> 38:20.990
Spatial craftsmanship

38:21.150 --> 38:22.150
is a mandatory course

38:22.150 --> 38:23.100
for students on Yingong Mountain.

38:23.100 --> 38:24.190
Your master knows it too?

38:24.510 --> 38:25.550
And he teaches you that?

38:28.230 --> 38:29.830
Why is what I heard different from this?

38:30.670 --> 38:32.750
What did you hear?

38:32.870 --> 38:34.390
I heard that Linglong House

38:34.390 --> 38:35.880
is the finest craftsmanship in the Mortal Realm.

38:35.950 --> 38:37.620
Goddess Wushuang became divine precisely because

38:37.620 --> 38:39.630
she created the method to build this

38:39.670 --> 38:41.390
and attained immortality through her craftsmanship.

38:41.430 --> 38:43.150
Although many people in later generations have tried to replicate it,

38:43.230 --> 38:44.590
they have never been able to replicate

38:44.590 --> 38:45.540
the true Linglong House's ability

38:45.540 --> 38:46.590
to shrink

38:46.790 --> 38:48.180
and stretch freely

38:48.180 --> 38:49.150
and its mysterious transformations.

38:49.830 --> 38:51.230
You know quite a lot.

38:53.350 --> 38:55.220
Can this one change size?

38:56.870 --> 38:58.150
It's indeed just a replica.

38:58.270 --> 38:59.830
It seems that spatial craftsmanship

38:59.830 --> 39:00.990
is quite difficult.

39:04.270 --> 39:06.150
The bag of yours that can store anything

39:06.230 --> 39:08.150
seems to work on the same principle.

39:08.740 --> 39:10.150
They're two completely different things.

39:14.280 --> 39:16.110
This is clearly a workshop,

39:16.150 --> 39:17.590
and there's a replica here.

39:17.910 --> 39:18.710
It couldn't be that

39:18.750 --> 39:20.350
we need to build a Linglong House in this challenge, could it?

39:20.710 --> 39:21.710
It seems so.

39:22.990 --> 39:24.350
Don't tell me you can do it too.

39:25.990 --> 39:27.020
Let's give it a try.

39:27.110 --> 39:28.950
What if we succeed?

39:29.950 --> 39:30.870
You can really make it?

39:31.070 --> 39:32.230
Why not?

39:32.390 --> 39:33.950
It was a lost art 1000 years ago.

39:33.950 --> 39:34.910
But now,

39:34.910 --> 39:36.310
isn't it just an ordinary skill?

39:36.870 --> 39:37.790
Is that so?

39:42.630 --> 39:43.550
For example,

39:43.550 --> 39:44.760
why are these four digits

39:45.550 --> 39:47.150
arranged in this particular order?

39:48.510 --> 39:50.150
When I was your age,

39:50.150 --> 39:51.270
whenever I felt agitated,

39:51.270 --> 39:53.190
I would copy a book called The Book of Calming

39:53.190 --> 39:55.320
and I would naturally calm down.

39:55.910 --> 39:56.990
The Book of Calming?

39:58.990 --> 39:59.700
What's that smell?

39:59.700 --> 40:01.020
Why is it so bad?

40:01.270 --> 40:02.070
What?

40:03.070 --> 40:04.670
I'm saying your chess move stinks.

40:04.830 --> 40:05.790
You made a move here.

40:05.790 --> 40:06.510
Doesn't that mean this entire area

40:06.510 --> 40:07.470
is mine now?

40:09.310 --> 40:10.830
I didn't see it. Let's me take a step back.

40:10.980 --> 40:11.830
Why are you taking a step back again?

40:11.830 --> 40:12.790
How many steps are you going to take back?

40:12.790 --> 40:14.350
Well, I didn't see it, did I?

40:15.590 --> 40:16.470
Fine, take it back then.

40:16.550 --> 40:17.950
Playing chess with you is so boring.

40:17.990 --> 40:18.950
Just wait until Kai Shan

40:18.950 --> 40:19.710
comes out.

40:19.870 --> 40:21.070
You want to play with him?

40:22.030 --> 40:23.070
By then, I won't play.

40:23.070 --> 40:24.070
I'll just watch you two play.

40:24.070 --> 40:24.870
With the way you're constantly taking steps back,

40:24.870 --> 40:26.150
he'll chop you in half.

40:26.150 --> 40:27.150
If you knew you couldn't make it,

40:27.310 --> 40:28.830
why did you make such a boast?

40:28.850 --> 40:29.900
Who says I can't make it?

40:30.530 --> 40:31.650
They're back.

40:33.550 --> 40:35.270
Why didn't you just break the formation earlier?

40:36.390 --> 40:37.650
I'm tired. I want to take a rest.

40:37.650 --> 40:38.590
Please be quiet now.

40:39.340 --> 40:40.850
The Book of Calming...

40:41.150 --> 40:42.430
Four-digit number...

40:43.230 --> 40:44.350
Linglong House?

40:53.310 --> 40:54.190
What's wrong with her?

40:55.150 --> 40:55.990
Where's Kai Shan?

40:57.230 --> 40:58.430
Why haven't you gone to sleep yet?

40:59.150 --> 41:00.870
We're worried about Kai Shan,

41:01.310 --> 41:02.150
so we can't sleep.

41:02.510 --> 41:03.870
What about you? How's it going?

41:03.870 --> 41:04.630
Not bad.

41:04.990 --> 41:06.190
We passed three challenges in a row,

41:06.230 --> 41:07.470
and only the final one is left.

41:26.470 --> 41:27.630
It's not here either.

41:28.550 --> 41:29.870
Could it be somewhere else?

41:34.870 --> 41:35.940
What are you looking for?

41:36.350 --> 41:37.310
A book.

41:37.990 --> 41:38.790
Do you need my help?

41:38.790 --> 41:39.550
No, thanks.

41:47.230 --> 41:48.470
That's the situation.

41:48.870 --> 41:49.830
In the final challenge,

41:49.860 --> 41:51.180
if I'm not mistaken,

41:51.260 --> 41:52.860
we have to build a Linglong House.

41:54.470 --> 41:55.040
Interesting.

41:56.150 --> 41:57.710
It really is brilliant.

41:58.070 --> 41:59.100
The Realm of the White Horse,

41:59.100 --> 42:00.060
the Star Map—

42:00.430 --> 42:01.590
each seal

42:01.590 --> 42:02.870
is a profound subject.

42:02.990 --> 42:03.750
And in the end,

42:03.750 --> 42:05.430
you even need to build a Linglong House.

42:06.750 --> 42:07.550
My goodness.

42:07.870 --> 42:09.630
This old guy really is something.

42:10.710 --> 42:12.030
Well, if that's the case,

42:12.150 --> 42:13.110
losing to him

42:13.150 --> 42:14.350
wasn't so shameful to me after all.

42:15.340 --> 42:16.220
You don't say.

42:16.310 --> 42:17.870
Kai Shan really knows how to find a good spot.

42:19.790 --> 42:21.630
It's almost dawn. Let's eat something.

42:21.870 --> 42:22.790
I'm hungry too.

42:25.830 --> 42:26.510
Is Ji Tanyin

42:26.510 --> 42:27.590
still looking for something?

42:28.670 --> 42:29.830
She's searched the entire mountain,

42:29.830 --> 42:31.310
not leaving any room unchecked.

42:31.350 --> 42:32.910
Looks like she's searching for a book.

42:33.150 --> 42:34.030
But she didn't answer when I asked her what book she was looking for.

42:34.470 --> 42:35.470
She's gone out now.
